```{=html}
<div class="tile-grid">
<% for (const item of items) { const external = String(item.path).startsWith("http"); %>
<a class="tile" href="<%- item.path %>" <%= external ? 'target="_blank" rel="noopener"' : '' %> <%= metadataAttrs(item) %>>
<img src="<%- item.image %>" alt="<%= item.title %>" loading="lazy">
<div class="tile-overlay">
<span class="tile-title"><%= item.title %></span>
<% if (item.subtitle) { %><span class="tile-label"><%= item.subtitle %><%= external ? ' ↗' : '' %></span><% } %>
</div>
</a>
<% } %>
</div>
```
